  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "西洋藝術賞析",
    "sub_ename": "APPRECIATION OF WESTERN ARTS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目的為西洋藝術史的基礎介紹，除了針對以下風格潮流導讀:文藝復興、巴洛克、洛可可、新古典、浪漫主義、印象派、後印象派、新藝術運動、表現主義、野獸派、立體派與超現實主義。並介紹法國巴黎著名的美術館:羅浮宮、奧賽美術館、龐畢度中心等。本課程將邀請藝術家演講，引導同參與西洋繪畫的透視與表現技法的實作賞析，透過國立臺灣美術館校外參訪活動，培養同學認識西方文化與審美素養。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to provide a basic introduction to the history of western art, with the exception of the following stylistic trends: Renaissance, Baroque, Rococo, Neoclassical, Romanticism, Impressionism, Post-Impressionism, Art Nouveau, Expressionism, Fauvism, Cubism, and Surrealism. It also introduces the famous art museums in Paris, France: Louvre, Mus?e d'Orsay, Centre Pompidou, etc. In this course, artists will be invited to give lectures, guide and participate in the practical appreciation of perspective and expressive techniques of Western painting, and cultivate students' understanding of western culture and aesthetic literacy through off-campus visits to the National Taiwan Museum of Fine Arts.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
