      "describe_en": "Possess the ability to conduct field research and discourse on local cultural resources and fieldwork"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具備文物藝術基本識別、登錄建檔與撰述能力",
      "describe_en": "Possess the basic ability of identification, registration, archiving and writing of cultural relics and art"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
